<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>SMBify Agency - Brand DNA</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        h1 { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; color: #1E293B; font-size: 28px; border-bottom: 2px solid #84CC16; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        h2 { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; color: #1E293B; font-size: 22px; margin-top: 20px; }
        h3 { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; color: #0F172A; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 15px; }
        p, li { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .highlight { font-weight: bold; color: #65A30D; }
        .color-box { display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 5px; vertical-align: middle; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>SMBify Agency - Brand DNA</h1>

<h2>1. Brand Identity</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Brand Name:</b> SMBify</li>
    <li><b>Niche/Industry:</b> Local SEO for Home-Service Businesses (Plumbers, Electricians, HVAC, etc.)</li>
    <li><b>Core Mission:</b> "We help home-service business owners dominate local search, rank at the top of the Google Map Pack, and secure a steady stream of phone calls for their trades."</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Brand Tone & Voice</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Authoritative & Expert:</b> We know what we are doing. We rely on data, proven strategies (Entity Stacking, Citation Building), and clear playbooks.</li>
    <li><b>Direct & Actionable:</b> No fluff. We tell our clients exactly what works and what doesn't.</li>
    <li><b>Modern & Premium:</b> Our agency feels high-end, trustworthy, and tech-forward.</li>
    <li><b>Conversational but Professional:</b> Friendly and approachable, yet strictly professional when it comes to business results.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Typography</h2>
<p>We use modern, clean, and highly legible Google Fonts to convey a tech-forward agency feel.</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>Primary Font (Body Text):</b> <code>Inter</code> (sans-serif)<br>
        <i>Usage:</i> Paragraphs, descriptions, buttons, UI elements.
    </li>
    <li><b>Secondary Font (Headings):</b> <code>Outfit</code> (sans-serif)<br>
        <i>Usage:</i> H1, H2, H3 headings, large display text, and numbers.
    </li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Brand Colors</h2>
<p>Our color palette revolves around a sleek "Dark Mode" aesthetic contrasted with a vibrant "Lime" accent to signify growth, energy, and digital success.</p>

<h3>Primary Colors (Accents & CTAs)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #84CC16;"></span> <b>Brand Lime (Primary Accent):</b> #84CC16</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #65A30D;"></span> <b>Brand Lime (Hover/Darker):</b> #65A30D</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #BEF264;"></span> <b>Brand Lime (Light/Glow):</b> #BEF264</li>
</ul>

<h3>Dark Theme / Background Colors</h3>
<ul>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #070A13;"></span> <b>Deep Space (Main Background):</b> #070A13</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #0D1220;"></span> <b>Midnight Blue (Secondary Background / Cards):</b> #0D1220</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #161E31;"></span> <b>Slate Navy (Tertiary Background / Borders):</b> #161E31</li>
</ul>

<h3>Text Colors (On Dark Backgrounds)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #F9FAFB;"></span> <b>Text Primary (White/Off-white):</b> #F9FAFB</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #E5E7EB;"></span> <b>Text Secondary (Light Gray):</b> #E5E7EB</li>
    <li><span class="color-box" style="background-color: #9CA3AF;"></span> <b>Text Tertiary (Muted Gray):</b> #9CA3AF</li>
</ul>

<h3>UI Elements & Gradients</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Hero Gradient:</b> Radial glow using rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.15) fading into dark blue #070a13.</li>
    <li><b>CTA Gradient:</b> Linear gradient from #84CC16 to #65A30D.</li>
    <li><b>Glassmorphism:</b> We use semi-transparent backgrounds rgba(13, 18, 32, 0.75) with subtle white borders rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) and heavy drop shadows to create depth.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Visual Aesthetic</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Layouts:</b> Clean, grid-based, ample whitespace, 3-column structures.</li>
    <li><b>Imagery:</b> Professional, high-quality agency and business owner imagery, often with dark overlays or glowing lime highlights.</li>
    <li><b>UI Micro-interactions:</b> Smooth hover effects, glow animations on buttons, and floating cards.</li>
</ul>

</body>
</html>
